<title>FINLAND: HELIBOR INTEREST RATES FALL ACROSS THE BOARD.</title>
<headline>HELIBOR INTEREST RATES FALL ACROSS THE BOARD.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Helibor interest rates fell at</p>
<p>the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Monday. The three-month</p>
<p>rate fell to 3.28 percent.</p>
<p>					Sept 16 fix	    Sept 13 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor		     3.23 pct		3.24 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor		     3.26 pct		3.27 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor		     3.28 pct		3.32 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor		     3.45 pct		3.46 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor		     3.57 pct		3.59 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor		    3.68 pct		3.70 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 240</p>
</text>
